        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Winstone\n- Films: The Magic Roundabout, Doogal, The Lord of the Springs\n- Concepts: voice acting, film production\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Winstone became well known as a voice-over actor and later branched out into film production.\n- The Magic Roundabout is a 2005 French-British computer-animated adventure fantasy film based on the television series The Magic Roundabout.\n- The film The Magic Roundabout was released in France as Pollux - Le manège enchanté.\n- The film The Magic Roundabout was redubbed in the United States as Doogal or The Lord of the Springs.",
